{"symbol":"SURYODAY","yahoo":"SURYODAY.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE428Q01011","name":"Suryoday Small Finance Bank Limited","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","website":"https://suryoday.bank.in","about":"Suryoday Small Finance Bank Limited provides financial products to micro-entrepreneurs and underserved communities and individuals in India. It operates through Treasury, Retail Banking, Corporate Banking, and Other Banking Operation segments. The company offers savings, salary, current, and special accounts; and term and fixed deposits, recurring, and double joy deposits. It also provides two-wheeler, commercial vehicle, and car loans; micro housing loans and micro LAP; home loan; secured business loan; personal loan; MSME loan; merchant loan for business; small business loan; and supply chain finance, as well as joint liability group and individual unsecured loans. In addition, the company offers debit and credit cards; life and general insurance services; social security schemes and mutual funds and broking services; inward and outward remittance services; and internet banking and mobile banking services. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Navi Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:41:26+00:00","quote":{"price":149.12,"prevClose":145.34,"marketCap":1585.1,"high52":218.0,"low52":115.41,"pe":8.27,"bookValue":195.53,"dividendRate":1.5,"roe":null,"shares":10.6297,"insiders":35.4,"institutions":19.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-03-26","2021-03-30","2021-03-31","2021-04-01","2021-04-05","2021-04-06","2021-04-07","2021-04-08","2021-04-09","2021-04-12","2021-04-13","2021-04-15","2021-04-16","2021-04-19","2021-04-20","2021-04-22","2021-04-23","2021-04-26","2021-04-27","2021-04-28","2021-04-29","2021-04-30","2021-05-03","2021-05-04","2021-05-05","2021-05-06","2021-05-07","2021-05-10","2021-05-11","2021-05-12","2021-05-14","2021-05-17","2021-05-18","2021-05-19","2021-05-20","2021-05-21","2021-05-24","2021-05-25","2021-05-26","2021-05